            ("p", "It is equally useful at the other end. Golfers chasing distance often assume they need to swing harder, when the speed they are missing is locked up in a restricted turn or a lack of ground force. Screening finds that, and the <a href=\"swingfit.html\">SwingFit programme</a> and <a href=\"tpi-screening.html\">TPI screening page</a> cover how we build the training around it."),
