            ("How long does it take?", "Around 45 minutes for the full screen, plus time afterwards to talk through your results and agree a plan. Most people are with us for a little over an hour in total."),
            ("Do I need to be fit already?", "No. The screen tells us where you are now, and the plan starts from there. Golfers of every age and fitness level book screenings, and a good number have never done structured training in their lives."),
